      wem : Set WEM address / database in acp-host-agent.conf	TAGS: [agent, phase7, wem]
      wem : Pre-seed Host Agent join-token	TAGS: [agent, phase7, wem]
      wem : Pre-stage otelcol override before the agent starts otelcol	TAGS: [agent, phase7, wem]
      wem : Enable and start Host Agent (한 대씩 순차 기동)	TAGS: [agent, phase7, wem]
      wem : Verify join-token is still the pre-seeded value	TAGS: [agent, phase7, wem]
      wem : Warn when the agent replaced the join-token	TAGS: [agent, phase7, wem]
